# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Circle Arc testnet — contract deployment
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The Arc RPC and chain ID are defined in hardhat.config.ts. The deployer key is
# consumed through configVariable(). Store it in the Hardhat keystore
# (recommended, encrypted at rest):
#
#   npx hardhat keystore set ARC_PRIVATE_KEY
#
# If you prefer plain env vars, copy this file to .env and load it
# before running hardhat (this project has no dotenv autoload):
#   set -a; source .env; set +a        # bash/zsh
#
# NOTE: .env is gitignored. Never commit a real private key.

# Deployer private key, 0x-prefixed. Must be funded on Arc testnet.
ARC_PRIVATE_KEY=0xREPLACE_WITH_DEPLOYER_PRIVATE_KEY
